      "created_at": "2016-12-07T10:29:21Z",
      "updated_at": "2016-12-07T10:29:21Z",
      "body": "Well, to the pure everything is pure. But think about what would happen if one of your close relatives fires up a private/anonymous browser window believing that the traffic would be long forgotten when the window is closed. But it is not because the beautiful pi-hole made a complete record of each and every site visited. Say if it was you girlfriend visiting dating sites this way and you browsed through the history. Don't your think she would consider her privacy breached just a little bit?",
      "author_association": "NONE",
      "pin": null,
