      "updated_at": "2016-12-07T11:27:43Z",
      "body": "No. Absolutely not!\r\n\r\nI just opened up an \"Incognito Window\" in Chrome. If she reads the text the browser shows her carefully, it should be clear to your girlfriend that she is **not invisible in incognito mode** (second paragraph).\r\n\r\n![screenshot at 2016-12-07 12-15-21](https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/16748619/20965656/0a45989c-bc77-11e6-8d04-4f116cc6bf86.png)\r\n\r\nThis is what Mozilla Firefox says\r\n![650x407x04_firefox02_private_browsing_tab png pagespeed gp jp jw pj js rj rp rw ri cp md ic cavgep5edr](https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/16748619/20965954/5c4d274e-bc78-11e6-8fc7-13082a6e869f.png)\r\n\r\n![screenshot at 2016-12-07 12-21-52](https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/16748619/20965804/bf7b18ae-bc77-11e6-855b-2b6ac1bafb02.png)\r\n",
