      "created_at": "2016-12-07T11:45:43Z",
      "updated_at": "2016-12-07T11:45:43Z",
      "body": "Yes, I agree and I understand you feel strongly about your solution. But provided I install it and make my users use it,  it still puts me in an awkward position that I would rather not be in. During my professional life I have never felt it more intimidating than when I occasionally had to debug other people's e-mail problems. \r\nI think your idea is great and installing it was like a dream. Still I also believe it needs some refinements like making a less experienced sys admin know what paths he entering if he installs the software.\r\nLet's close the discussion for now.\r\n",
      "author_association": "NONE",
      "pin": null,
