      "updated_at": "2016-12-07T12:02:21Z",
      "body": "Please rest assured that we take your concerns seriously!\r\n\r\nIn the next release you will be able to disable logging very conveniently:\r\n```bash\r\npi@raspberry:~ $ sudo pihole -l off\r\n::: Flushing /var/log/pihole.log ...... done!\r\n::: Logging has been disabled!\r\n```\r\n\r\nSince, however, most of the users don't consider the logs as privacy issue, we leave logging enabled by default.",
